        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093400/extras/dcbd0f9343b216f78f11e2281616fbe1.avif?t=1781715029\" width=780 height=497 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When their mother warns these twins that they can't stay together forever, their closely knit bonds of sisterhoods are forever changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this sweet, romantic, yuri visual novel, you'll follow the perspectives of both twin sisters as Ichika realizes her love is more than familial and Futaba grapples with her hesitation. Both sisters are aware of how their feelings may change their relationship, and how society would generally view it, but can they find a way to make it work? What will their relationship look like if they can? And what if they can't?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093400/extras/3c30fd56c8e5865fab5668083e05fa30.avif?t=1781715029\" width=780 height=326 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy all the sweet, tender moments these sisters share as their love blossoms.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093400/extras/a41655fcb02a3d2d872f0292a1404977.avif?t=1781715029\" width=780 height=326 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the developments from the eyes of both twins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093400/extras/d5d6b39f6e692207893747d3755da41c.avif?t=1781715029\" width=780 height=497 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093400/extras/b524d8613b6131ab9db36c5d688be615.poster.avif?t=1781715029\" width=780 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093400/extras/b524d8613b6131ab9db36c5d688be615.webm?t=1781715029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093400/extras/317f9a8df86c87001566fca2ccb468ee.poster.avif?t=1781715029\" width=780 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093400/extras/317f9a8df86c87001566fca2ccb468ee.webm?t=1781715029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093400/extras/dcbd0f9343b216f78f11e2281616fbe1.avif?t=1781715029\" width=780 height=497 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When their mother warns these twins that they can't stay together forever, their closely knit bonds of sisterhoods are forever changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this sweet, romantic, yuri visual novel, you'll follow the perspectives of both twin sisters as Ichika realizes her love is more than familial and Futaba grapples with her hesitation. Both sisters are aware of how their feelings may change their relationship, and how society would generally view it, but can they find a way to make it work? What will their relationship look like if they can? And what if they can't?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093400/extras/3c30fd56c8e5865fab5668083e05fa30.avif?t=1781715029\" width=780 height=326 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy all the sweet, tender moments these sisters share as their love blossoms.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093400/extras/a41655fcb02a3d2d872f0292a1404977.avif?t=1781715029\" width=780 height=326 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the developments from the eyes of both twins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093400/extras/d5d6b39f6e692207893747d3755da41c.avif?t=1781715029\" width=780 height=497 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093400/extras/b524d8613b6131ab9db36c5d688be615.poster.avif?t=1781715029\" width=780 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093400/extras/b524d8613b6131ab9db36c5d688be615.webm?t=1781715029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093400/extras/317f9a8df86c87001566fca2ccb468ee.poster.avif?t=1781715029\" width=780 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093400/extras/317f9a8df86c87001566fca2ccb468ee.webm?t=1781715029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2>",
